<article class="env-lemma" id="00GO">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/00GO">Lemma <span data-tag="00GO">10.36.7</span>.</a> Let $R \to S$ be a ring homomorphism. The set </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  S' = \{ s \in S \mid s\text{ is integral over }R\}   \]
</div>
  <p> is an $R$-subalgebra of $S$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is clear from Lemmas <a href="/tag/00GM" data-tag="00GM">10.36.4</a> and <a href="/tag/00GK" data-tag="00GK">10.36.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>